      "q": "A boy weighing 60 kg f is wearing shoes with heel area of cross-section 20 cm\u00b2 while a girl weighing 45 kg f wearing shoes with heel of area of cross-section 1.5 cm\u00b2. Compare the pressure exerted on ground by their heels when they stand on the heel of one foot.",
